{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-throughput-serving-optimization","title":"多模态推理延迟、吞吐与显存优化（编码缓存/分块）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/inference-serving-systems/latency-throughput-serving-optimization","wordCount":2812,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模态推理延迟-吞吐与显存优化-编码缓存-分块\">多模态推理延迟、吞吐与显存优化（编码缓存/分块）</h1><p>同样是 7B 参数的模型，纯文本服务端在单张 H100 上能跑到每秒上千 token 的输出吞吐，换成视觉语言模型（VLM）处理一张 1024×1024 的图，首 token 延迟（TTFT）可能直接从 80ms 涨到 800ms——变的不是权重，而是输入通路上多出来的一整段视觉编码。多模态性能工程的本质，是把「一次请求」拆成三段互不相同的计算（取媒体、跑编码器、跑语言模型）再分别施压。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次多模态请求被拆成三个阶段：<strong>媒体加载与解码</strong>（取图或视频、解码成张量）、<strong>视觉编码</strong>（ViT 或同类编码器把像素压成图像 token 嵌入）、<strong>语言模型前向</strong>（图像 token 与文本 token 拼成序列，先 prefill 再自回归 decode）。三段计算特征完全不同：解码是 CPU 绑定的，编码器是 GPU 上短而密集的一批矩阵乘，语言模型 prefill 受序列长度平方影响、decode 受显存带宽影响。指标也因此分开定义——<strong>TTFT</strong> 覆盖前两段加 prefill，<strong>TPOT/ITL</strong>（每 token 输出时间）只反映 decode，<strong>吞吐</strong>由显存而非算力决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;请求:图/视频 + 文本&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;媒体加载与解码&lt;br/&gt;CPU 绑定&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;视觉编码器&lt;br/&gt;ViT,GPU 密集短批&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;图像 token 嵌入&lt;br/&gt;进入 LLM 序列&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Prefill&lt;br/&gt;受序列长度平方影响&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Decode&lt;br/&gt;显存带宽绑定&quot;]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|&quot;编码缓存命中则跳过&quot;| D&#10;    C -.-&gt;|&quot;嵌入缓存命中则跳过&quot;| D&#10;    E -.-&gt;|&quot;prefix caching 命中则跳过&quot;| F\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"请求:图/视频 + 文本\"] --&gt; B[\"媒体加载与解码&lt;br/&gt;CPU 绑定\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"视觉编码器&lt;br/&gt;ViT,GPU 密集短批\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"图像 token 嵌入&lt;br/&gt;进入 LLM 序列\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Prefill&lt;br/&gt;受序列长度平方影响\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Decode&lt;br/&gt;显存带宽绑定\"]\n    B -.-&gt;|\"编码缓存命中则跳过\"| D\n    C -.-&gt;|\"嵌入缓存命中则跳过\"| D\n    E -.-&gt;|\"prefix caching 命中则跳过\"| F</pre><p>各阶段对三大指标的敏感度可用下表定位瓶颈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n<th>对 TTFT</th>\n<th>对吞吐</th>\n<th>对显存</th>\n<th>可缓存层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>媒体加载/解码</td>\n<td>CPU、网络 IO</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>弱（可并发）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>解码结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视觉编码</td>\n<td>GPU 算力</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（激活）</td>\n<td>图像嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefill</td>\n<td>GPU 算力、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>KV 增长</td>\n<td>KV cache</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decode</td>\n<td>显存带宽</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>KV 常驻</td>\n<td>无（逐 token）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟的构成可以直接写成加法，这是容量规划的起点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>load</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>encode</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>prefill</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{TTFT} = t_{\\text{load}} + t_{\\text{encode}} + t_{\\text{prefill}} + t_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">TTFT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">load</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">encode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prefill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是排队等待时间。前两项在多模态里不是零头：vLLM 的媒体加载超时默认值是图像 5 秒、视频 30 秒、音频 10 秒（来源：vLLM Multimodal Inputs 文档），远端取图的尾部延迟可远超模型计算本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编码缓存-跳过重复的视觉计算\">编码缓存：跳过重复的视觉计算</h2><p>同一张商品图会在搜索、推荐、客服等多个链路被反复送进模型，若每次都重跑 ViT，等于把最贵的一段算力浪费在完全相同的输入上。<strong>编码缓存</strong>（encoder cache，也叫嵌入缓存或媒体处理缓存）对媒体内容做哈希，命中则直接取用此前算好的图像嵌入，跳过解码与编码。</p>\n<p>vLLM 给每个媒体项按内容哈希使已处理的工作可跨请求复用，并提供 <code>multi_modal_uuids</code> 让调用方用稳定 ID 替代内容哈希。文档明确了一条关键约束：媒体数据可在预期 UUID 命中时省略不传，但 UUID 未命中则请求失败；「若多模态处理器缓存与 prefix caching 同时关闭，用户提供的 <code>multi_modal_uuids</code> 会被忽略」（来源：vLLM Multimodal Inputs 文档）。这揭示两层缓存是联动的——图像嵌入进入序列之后，其 KV 块才会被 prefix 缓存索引。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存层</th>\n<th>键</th>\n<th>命中后跳过</th>\n<th>命中前提</th>\n<th>失效风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>媒体处理缓存</td>\n<td>内容哈希或 UUID</td>\n<td>解码 + 编码</td>\n<td>媒体字节完全一致</td>\n<td>字节微变即未命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefix caching</td>\n<td>前缀块哈希</td>\n<td>共享前缀的 prefill</td>\n<td>序列前缀逐 token 一致</td>\n<td>图像 token 位置变动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非前缀复用</td>\n<td>块级匹配（CacheBlend 类）</td>\n<td>部分重算</td>\n<td>允许位置不同</td>\n<td>需选择性重算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>语言模型侧的缓存由 prefix caching 承担：它存储此前请求的 KV，新请求若有相同前缀就「跳过共享部分的计算」（来源：vLLM Automatic Prefix Caching 文档），收益只作用于 prefill。SGLang 的 RadixAttention 把它做成基数树（radix tree）管理复用，论文报告相对当时最优系统「最高 6.4 倍吞吐」，benchmark 覆盖多模态模型（来源：SGLang，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07104\">arXiv:2312.07104</a>）。当缓存要跨请求、跨实例存活时，需把 KV 从 GPU 显存挪到分层存储——LMCache 把 KV 移入「跨越 CPU 内存、本地存储和远端后端的分层结构」，支持 Redis、S3、Mooncake、NIXL 等后端，并在 2025 年 7 月宣布 vLLM V1 的多模态支持（来源：LMCache 官方文档）。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，编码缓存的粒度是「整张图」、语言侧缓存是「token 块」：图像字节任何改动都会让编码缓存未命中，而图像 token 一旦生成，只要后续文本前缀不变，KV 复用即生效。常见组合是用 UUID 精确命中编码缓存，用 prefix caching 吸收多轮对话的重复前缀。编码器算力也不可忽视：单图编码在 ViT-L 量级即百亿次运算，高并发未命中时会与语言模型争抢同一块 GPU——这正是把编码器单独部署的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分块预填充-把长-prefill-切碎以稳住-itl\">分块预填充：把长 prefill 切碎以稳住 ITL</h2><p>当一张图贡献几千个 token、再叠加长系统提示，prefill 一次就能吃掉几十到数百毫秒。若服务端把整段 prefill 当作不可分割的批执行，正在 decode 的请求必须等它跑完才能出一个 token——ITL 出现尖刺。<strong>分块预填充</strong>（chunked prefill）把长 prefill 切成多个小块，与 decode 请求混进同一批次执行，用 <code>--max-num-batched-tokens</code> 控批。</p>\n<p>代价是一对权衡：切得越碎，decode 的 ITL 越平稳，但 TTFT 上升；切得越粗，TTFT 更低，但 decode 被阻塞。设一块 chunk 含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token、批内 decode 请求为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个，则单块执行时间近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{chunk}} \\approx \\alpha + \\beta \\cdot c + \\gamma \\cdot B_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是核启动开销，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是 prefill 算力项，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma B_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 decode 带宽项。ITL 上界约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{chunk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，所以调 <code>--max-num-batched-tokens</code> 本质是在 TTFT 与 ITL 之间选工作点：调到能一次吞下整图 token 数则 TTFT 最优、ITL 最差，反之亦然。</p>\n<p>分块预填充与 prefix caching 互相影响：缓存命中的前缀可整段跳过，二者叠加时被切成块的往往只剩「未命中」的那一段。这也是把系统提示与固定图像模板放序列最前、变量文本放后面能显著提速的原因。</p>\n<p>对多模态还有一个特有陷阱：<strong>图像 token 的位置会随动态分辨率变化</strong>。Qwen2-VL 采用「朴素动态分辨率」机制，让模型「把不同分辨率的图像处理成不同数量的视觉 token」（来源：Qwen2-VL，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.12191\">arXiv:2409.12191</a>）。同一张图缩放后 token 数改变，图像之后的所有 token 位置后移，prefix 缓存的块哈希随之全部失配。所以把高分辨率图做固定尺寸归一化、稳定图像 token 数，往往比压缩分辨率更能提升缓存命中——这与<a href=\"../multimodal-architecture-representation/unified-vs-modular-architectures\">统一架构与模块化架构</a>讨论的 token 序列形态是同一问题的两面，也与同章的<a href=\"multimodal-context-token-budget\">多模态上下文与 token 预算</a>直接相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"显存优化-kv-预算-视频剪枝与-p-d-分离\">显存优化：KV 预算、视频剪枝与 P/D 分离</h2><p>批量服务的吞吐上限通常不是算力，而是显存里能装下多少 KV。设层数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、KV 头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、头维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、精度字节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（FP16 为 2）、序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、并发批 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>kv</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{kv}} = 2 \\cdot L \\cdot H_{kv} \\cdot d_h \\cdot b \\cdot n \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>系数 2 来自 key 与 value 两份。视频把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 推到极端：一段几十秒的视频经时空 patch 后可产生数万 token，KV 显存吃满，直接压垮并发。减轻手段有三类。其一是 <strong>token 剪枝</strong>：vLLM 的 <code>--video-pruning-rate</code> 在视觉编码器之后移除比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的视频 token，用于「缩短 prefill 并减少 KV cache 使用」，代价是精度；<code>--video-pruning-method</code> 可选 <code>evs</code>（默认，保留首帧完整并移除与前一帧最不相似的 token）与 <code>vidcom2</code>（当前仅限 Qwen3-VL）。注意启用剪枝会禁用编码器的 CUDA graph，因为保留 token 数变成数据依赖（来源：vLLM Multimodal Inputs 文档）——剪枝省下的是显存，付出的是核启动开销。</p>\n<p>其二是 <strong>降低精度</strong>：KV 量化（FP8/INT8）直接缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，性价比最高。其三是<strong>架构性分离</strong>——<strong>Prefill/Decode 分离</strong>（disaggregated serving）。NVIDIA Dynamo 的论点是：prefill 是「计算绑定」、decode 是「显存绑定」，两者放一起会浪费 GPU，分离后各用不同并行度。Dynamo 在 GTC 2025（2025 年 3 月）公布：DeepSeek-R1 671B 在 GB200 NVL72 上以分离式服务「把可服务请求数提升最高 30 倍」（标注为预测值），Llama 70B 在 Hopper 上吞吐「翻倍以上」（来源：NVIDIA Dynamo 发布博客，2025-03-18）。其 Smart Router「对传入请求做哈希并存入基数树」并路由到已缓存对应 KV 的 worker——这正是把 prefix caching 从单机扩展到集群的做法。</p>\n<p>把上述手段落成一份参数清单，一张表即可覆盖绝大多数调优决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降 TTFT</td>\n<td>编码缓存 / prefix caching</td>\n<td><code>multi_modal_uuids</code>、<code>enable_prefix_caching</code></td>\n<td>缓存显存、一致性要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳 ITL</td>\n<td>分块预填充</td>\n<td><code>--max-num-batched-tokens</code></td>\n<td>TTFT 上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提吞吐</td>\n<td>提高并发批 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、KV 量化</td>\n<td><code>gpu_memory_utilization</code>、KV 精度</td>\n<td>精度、OOM 风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>省显存</td>\n<td>视频 token 剪枝</td>\n<td><code>--video-pruning-rate</code></td>\n<td>精度、禁用 encoder CUDA graph</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩容集群</td>\n<td>P/D 分离 + 分层 KV 存储</td>\n<td>Dynamo / LMCache</td>\n<td>部署复杂度、传输开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"度量与容量规划\">度量与容量规划</h2><p>优化之前先建立度量，否则无法判断瓶颈落在哪一段。最小可用的观测面是分段耗时（<code>t_load</code> / <code>t_encode</code> / <code>t_prefill</code> 各自 P50/P99）、分开统计的媒体与 prefix 命中率、以及 KV 占用率。没有分段数据时，最常见的误判是把编码器瓶颈当成语言模型瓶颈去调批参数。</p>\n<p>容量规划从 TTFT 预算反推：若 SLO 规定 P99 TTFT ≤ 500ms，扣掉排队与网络后，剩余预算在编码与 prefill 之间分配，而「允许的最大分辨率」往往先被 SLO 限制、而非显存限制。实践规则是：<strong>先用缓存把重复输入的成本压到接近于零，再用分块和剪枝处理真正的新输入，最后才考虑加卡。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多模态请求拆成媒体加载、视觉编码、语言模型三段，瓶颈各不相同；TTFT 是三者之和加排队，<code>t_load</code> 在大规模远端取图下不是零头。</li>\n<li>编码缓存（内容哈希 / <code>multi_modal_uuids</code>）跳过解码与编码，prefix caching（块哈希）跳过共享前缀的 prefill；vLLM 文档明确二者联动，同时关闭时 <code>multi_modal_uuids</code> 被忽略。</li>\n<li>SGLang 的 RadixAttention 用基数树管理 KV 复用，报告最高 6.4 倍吞吐；LMCache 把 KV 分层到 CPU/SSD/远端，2025 年 7 月起在 vLLM V1 支持多模态。</li>\n<li>分块预填充用 <code>--max-num-batched-tokens</code> 在 TTFT 与 ITL 之间选工作点，单块时间近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha + \\beta c + \\gamma B_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，构成 ITL 上界。</li>\n<li>显存优化三条路：视频 token 剪枝（代价是禁用 encoder CUDA graph）、KV 量化、P/D 分离；Dynamo 在 GTC 2025 报告分离式服务把可服务请求数提升最高 30 倍（预测值）。</li>\n<li>动态分辨率会让图像 token 数变化，打断 prefix 缓存命中；固定图像尺寸归一化常比压缩分辨率更有收益。</li>\n<li>落地顺序：先建分段度量，再用缓存吃掉重复输入，其次分块稳 ITL，最后才加卡扩容。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态推理延迟、吞吐与显存优化（编码缓存/分块）","id":"多模态推理延迟-吞吐与显存优化-编码缓存-分块"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编码缓存：跳过重复的视觉计算","id":"编码缓存-跳过重复的视觉计算"},{"level":2,"text":"分块预填充：把长 prefill 切碎以稳住 ITL","id":"分块预填充-把长-prefill-切碎以稳住-itl"},{"level":2,"text":"显存优化：KV 预算、视频剪枝与 P/D 分离","id":"显存优化-kv-预算-视频剪枝与-p-d-分离"},{"level":2,"text":"度量与容量规划","id":"度量与容量规划"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图像/视频 token 预算与上下文管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/inference-serving-systems/multimodal-context-token-budget"},"next":{"title":"模态缺失、损坏与超限输入的降级与异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/inference-serving-systems/degraded-input-failure-handling"}}